.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# what players' iPhones / iPads noted for the shared shader list (ios/tools/shader_contrib_watch.py): sent in an issue, not committed
/shader-list-contribution/
# never commit keys or game files
*.keys
*.xci
*.nsp
*.nca
*.nsz
*.xcz
*.bfttf
*.sav
# build output (the work folder normally lives next to the card image)
TOTK_build/
*.app/
games/totk/.venv
games/totk/build/
games/totk/extracted/
games/totk/rewritten/
games/totk/analysis/
games/totk/tooling/
games/totk/user-data/
games/totk/tools/totk_xlate/obj/
games/totk/tools/totk_xlate/bin/
games/totk/scripts/shader_inventory/obj/
games/totk/scripts/shader_inventory/bin/
ultracode.md
# local offline copy: game dumps/keys, vendored dependency bundle, source-built translator, packaged output
/dumps/
# the large vendored blobs stay local; the small hash lists / locks / pins the build trusts are tracked, so any
# change to them (the dependency-injection guard) shows up in git diff
/dependencies/*
!/dependencies/README.md
!/dependencies/manifest.json
!/dependencies/requirements-macos-arm64-py314.lock
!/dependencies/homebrew-pins.json
!/dependencies/dotnet/
/dependencies/dotnet/*
!/dependencies/dotnet/README.md
!/dependencies/dotnet/NuGet.Config
!/dependencies/dotnet/SHA256SUMS
!/dependencies/dotnet/global.json
!/dependencies/dotnet/toolchain.txt
!/dependencies/dotnet/locks/
# signing settings of the dedicated signing Apple ID (see .signing.env.example)
/.signing.env
/build-artifacts/
/dist/
